### End-state comparison: Ansible node vs Puppet node ###

Both implement the same Stage 13 specification.
ansible/group_vars/attendance_servers.yml and puppet/data/common.yaml
hold deliberately identical values, and both nodes deploy the very
same artefact file (/artifacts/attendance-1.0.0.war).

ANSIBLE (attendance-node)                                      | PUPPET (attendance-node-puppet)                               
---------------------------------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------
user:    attendance:1501:1501:/usr/sbin/nologin                | user:    attendance:1501:1501:/usr/sbin/nologin                =
group:   attendance:1501                                       | group:   attendance:1501                                       =
dir:     755 attendance:attendance /opt/attendance             | dir:     755 attendance:attendance /opt/attendance             =
dir:     755 attendance:attendance /opt/attendance/releases    | dir:     755 attendance:attendance /opt/attendance/releases    =
dir:     750 attendance:attendance /var/lib/attendance         | dir:     750 attendance:attendance /var/lib/attendance         =
dir:     750 attendance:attendance /var/log/attendance         | dir:     750 attendance:attendance /var/log/attendance         =
dir:     750 root:attendance /etc/attendance                   | dir:     750 root:attendance /etc/attendance                   =
envfile: 640 root:attendance sha=d7d80cc6d09a6e22              | envfile: 640 root:attendance sha=7810418268a72b91              *
unit:    644 root:root sha=dcd920cdc6eaebff                    | unit:    644 root:root sha=3e8a38ffdce298da                    *
nginx:   sha=371140b8a236caf3                                  | nginx:   sha=dc4271beaf5e25d0                                  *
symlink: /opt/attendance/current -> /opt/attendance/releases/1.0.0 | symlink: /opt/attendance/current -> /opt/attendance/releases/1.0.0 =
war:     attendance:attendance 63815182 sha=4bee7d6f0598b1b5   | war:     attendance:attendance 63815182 sha=4bee7d6f0598b1b5   =
svc:     attendance=active/enabled nginx=active/enabled        | svc:     attendance=active/enabled nginx=active/enabled        =
runas:   attendance                                            | runas:   attendance                                            =
health:  {"status":"UP"}                                       | health:  {"status":"UP"}                                       =
info:    {"app":{"name":"Student Attendance Management Portal","environment":"production"}} | info:    {"app":{"name":"Student Attendance Management Portal","environment":"production"}} =
